#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:374
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "ການໂຮສຕິ້ງ Zinn® ສຳລັບ WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:375
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, ການສໍາຮອງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈໍາວັນ, ການຍ້າຍເວັບໄຊຟຣີ ແລະ ແຜງຄວບຄຸມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສໍາລັບຜູ້ທີ່ບໍລິຫານຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງເວັບໄຊ."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:381
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດ Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:382
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "ຊື້ ແລະ ຂາຍເວັບໄຊ, ໂດເມນ ແລະ ການວາງລິ້ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ໂດຍມີການເກັບຮັກສາເງິນໄວ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ ຈົນກວ່າທັງສອງຝ່າຍຈະພໍໃຈ."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:429
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — ຈ້າງຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານທີ່ເຮັດວຽກນີ້ເປັນອາຊີບ"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:430
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດຟຣີແລນຊ໌ທົ່ວໂລກຂອງພວກເຮົາ: ເລືອກເບິ່ງບໍລິການສຳເລັດຮູບຫຼາຍກວ່າ 10,000 ການບໍລິການຈາກນັກຂຽນ, ນັກອອກແບບ, ຜູ້ພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານ SEO, ຫຼື ປະກາດໂຄງການແລ້ວໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສະເໜີລາຄາ."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:109
msgid "Style preset"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບສຳເລັດຮູບ"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:110
msgid "A starting point. Anything below overrides it."
msgstr "ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສິ່ງໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຈະທັບຊ້ອນມັນ."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:117
msgid "Use my own colours and sizes"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສີ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງຂ້ອຍເອງ"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:118
msgid "Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is."
msgstr "ປິດໄວ້ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າຕັ້ງຕົ້ນຕາມທີ່ມັນເປັນຢູ່ແທ້ໆ."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:233
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຂອງ Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:288
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາບໍ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."
